  "description": "Platform MCP stdio server (ironbrain-mcp) for Cursor and other bots.\n      Authenticates as an Ironbrain account (Supabase JWT) and enqueues HITL Outbox actions\n      via Ironbrain.Api — bots never hold IMAP/SMTP adapter secrets.\n      Distinct from Ironbrain.MailCal.Mcp (local mail/calendar extract).",
  "id": "Ironbrain.Mcp",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-29T10:50:46.703Z",
