  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.1 — get_action + Freigabe read grant surface (code from #36; package bump for nuget.org).\nAdds MCP get_action (GET /api/outbox/actions/{id}) so bots learn approve vs deny and read\ngrantToken after Freigabe. Read tools (list_emails, get_email, list_calendars, list_appointments)\naccept pending_freigabe envelopes, optional confidence/rationale, and grantToken re-fetch via\nX-Ironbrain-Read-Grant. See docs/mcp.md and docs/outbox.md §7.2.\nPublish via CI Trusted Publishing (.github/workflows/publish-ironbrain-mcp.yml);\ntag ironbrain-mcp-v0.2.1 or workflow_dispatch version 0.2.1.\nInstall/update: dotnet tool install -g Ironbrain.Mcp / dotnet tool update -g Ironbrain.Mcp.",
